    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. some of the people at my meetings are saying that the single-family stuff is basically just an outdated way of doing things that's making the housing crisis worse. do you think there's any actual modern evidence that supports the single-family model, or is it mostly just about preserving the way things used to be?",
